@* Pass 27 (ruling R27.3): the CC of a berserk Infantry OVR onto a lone SMC, resolved at once in the MPh once the DEFENDER's window on the entry
   has closed (A4.152, A15.432). Every berserk unit there attacks the SMC, and the SMC attacks them back when it can, since that never costs it
   anything. Every view sees the notice; only a view that may act for the phasing side proposes the CC. *@
<div class="toolbar" id="overrun-cc" data-location="@Location" role="status" aria-live="polite">
    <span class="fail">
        @Say(string.Join(", ", Attackers)) overran the lone @Say(Smc) in @Say(Location): their CC comes now, before anything else this MPh@(SmcAttacks ? Say($", and {Smc} attacks back") : Say($"; {Smc} cannot attack back")). If both survive they are
        held in Melee for the CCPh (A4.152, A15.432).
    </span>
    @if (Ready)
    {
        <button id="propose-overrun-cc" @onclick="@(() => OnPropose.InvokeAsync())">Propose: the OVR's CC</button>
    }
</div>

@code {
    /// <summary>The page's words for the view (pass 31c, design D11): a unit's name for its id, a Location in words.</summary>
    [CascadingParameter(Name = "Say")]
    public Func<string, string>? Words { get; set; }

    private string Say(string? text) => text is null ? string.Empty : Words?.Invoke(text) ?? text;

    /// <summary>The Location of the OVR.</summary>
    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public string Location { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    /// <summary>The berserk units that overran the SMC, who all attack it.</summary>
    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public IReadOnlyList<string> Attackers { get; set; } = [];

    /// <summary>The lone SMC overrun.</summary>
    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public string Smc { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    /// <summary>Whether the SMC attacks the berserk units back: it does whenever it may attack in CC (not broken or captured).</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public bool SmcAttacks { get; set; }

    /// <summary>Whether this view may propose the CC (the phasing side's, or the adjudicator's).</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public bool Ready { get; set; }

    [Parameter]
    public EventCallback OnPropose { get; set; }
}
